<div class="lf-page">
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 1: COVER ═══════════════ -->
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy <span style="font-weight:400;color:#C9A84C;font-size:14px;">· LF Academy</span></div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小五 · 第 12 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">DecimalMultiplication（Decimal×整數＋Decimal×Decimal）</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元四 · Decimal運算（Multiplication） · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》5上A冊 單元四 ＋ 現代教育 5上A 單元13<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T2 Decimal點定位 — 位數加總法 · 0.3×0.4=0.12≠1.2 · 乘10/100/1000移位<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試每年必考，佔卷一約 12-15%<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>P4Decimal加減、P4Decimal×整數（基礎）、整數Multiplication、Decimal位值概念<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ Decimal×整數（位數法） ❷ Decimal×Decimal（位數加總法） ❸ ×10/100/1000 vs ×0.1/0.01 ❹ DecimalMultiplicationWord Problems
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🔢 小數點獵人</div><div class="lf-game-desc">追蹤小數點位置！乘法向右、除法向左。小心0的數量陷阱！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🎯 開始追蹤 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>計算 24 × 3 = ？再計算 2.4 × 3 = ？（提示：先當 24×3=72，再處理Decimal點）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>計算 1.25 × 4 = ？（提示：先當 125×4=500，1.25有2個Decimal位→答案有2個 → 5.00 = 5）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>數Decimal位：0.3 有幾個Decimal位？0.25 呢？0.125 呢？（關鍵：Multiplication的位數加總法）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>把 0.3 × 0.4 轉為 3 × 4 = 12。兩個Factor共有多少個Decimal位？答案應該是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>計算 3.2 × 10 = ？3.2 × 100 = ？3.2 ÷ 10 = ？（觀察Decimal點移動方向與位數）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Decimal×整數 —「先當整數計，再數Decimal位」<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>Decimal×整數三步法：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>先當整數計</strong>：忽略Decimal點，當成整數Multiplication計算<br/>
      ② <strong>數Decimal位</strong>：原來Decimal有幾多個Decimal位？<br/>
      ③ <strong>點Decimal點</strong>：在乘積中從右向左數相同位數，點上Decimal點<br/>
<strong>例：</strong>2.4 × 3 = 先計 24×3=72，2.4有1個Decimal位 → 72 → 7.2
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：2.4 × 3 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">2.4 × 3 = 72（遺漏Decimal點！）</div><div class="why">忘記數Decimal位並點上Decimal點</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">2.4 × 3 = 7.2</div><div class="why">24×3=72，2.4有1個Decimal位 → 7.2</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「遮住Decimal點，當整數計，計完數位數，從右數返點」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最Common Mistake：乘完忘記點Decimal點！記住：Decimal×整數 = 先當整數計，最後一定要點Decimal點。</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 Worked Examples</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td>計算 2.4 × 3 = ？（24×3=72，Decimal位：1 → 答案 = 7.2）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td>計算 1.25 × 4 = ？（125×4=500，Decimal位：2 → 答案 = 5.00 = 5）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：Decimal×Decimal —「位數加總法」<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考殺手</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>Decimal×Decimal的位數加總法：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>先當整數計</strong>：忽略所有Decimal點，當整數×整數計算<br/>
      ② <strong>位數加總</strong>：數兩個Factor各有幾個Decimal位，<strong>相加</strong>得總位數<br/>
      ③ <strong>點Decimal點</strong>：在乘積中從右向左數總位數，點上Decimal點<br/>
      ④ <strong>補零</strong>：如果乘積位數不夠，在前面補零<br/>
<strong>例：</strong>0.3 × 0.4 → 3×4=12，Decimal位(1+1)=2 → 0.12<br/>
<strong>⚠️ 0.3×0.4=0.12，不是 1.2！</strong>（這是最多人錯的Trap！）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap對比例題（本堂核心）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：0.3 × 0.4 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 典型錯誤（70%學生第一次都錯）</div><div class="eq">0.3 × 0.4 = 1.2</div><div class="why">35%+學生直覺認為 0.3×0.4=1.2（兩個Decimal相乘應該變大？錯！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法（位數加總法）</div><div class="eq">0.3 × 0.4 = 0.12</div><div class="why">3×4=12，兩個Factor各有1個Decimal位，共2個 → 從右數2位 → 0.12</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「Decimal×Decimal，位數要加總；0.3×0.4=0.12，唔係1.2！」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：兩個小於1的Decimal相乘，結果會<strong>比兩個Factor都小</strong>！0.3×0.4=0.12（0.12 &lt; 0.3 且 0.12 &lt; 0.4）</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 補零Trap：0.2×0.3=0.06（3×2=6，總Decimal位=2，需要在6前面補一個零 → 0.06）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 Worked Examples</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例3</td><td>計算 0.3 × 0.4 = ？（位數加總：1+1=2，3×4=12 → 0.12）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例4</td><td>計算 0.25 × 0.3 = ？（位數加總：2+1=3，25×3=75 → 0.075）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：乘10/100/1000 vs 乘0.1/0.01/0.001 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>Decimal點移位法則：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>×10</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>右</strong>移1位（數字變大）<br/>
      ② <strong>×100</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>右</strong>移2位<br/>
      ③ <strong>×1000</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>右</strong>移3位<br/>
      ④ <strong>×0.1</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>左</strong>移1位（= ÷10，數字變小）<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>×0.01</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>左</strong>移2位（= ÷100）<br/>
      ⑥ <strong>×0.001</strong>：Decimal點向<strong>左</strong>移3位（= ÷1000）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">→</div><div class="t">×10/100/1000</div><div class="d">Decimal點<br/>向右移</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">←</div><div class="t">×0.1/0.01/0.001</div><div class="d">Decimal點<br/>向左移</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">0</div><div class="t">位數不夠</div><div class="d">在前面<br/>補零</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">✓</div><div class="t">驗算</div><div class="d">×10變大<br/>×0.1變小</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例5：計算 3.2 × 10 = ？3.2 × 100 = ？3.2 × 1000 = ？（Decimal點向右移）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：計算 56 × 0.1 = ？5.6 × 0.01 = ？56 × 0.01 = ？（Decimal點向左移）</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：DecimalMultiplicationWord Problems <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>DecimalMultiplicationWord Problems——注意單位與Decimal位：</strong><br/>
      ① 「每單位A × 數量B」= 總量（如：每公斤$12.5 × 3.2公斤）<br/>
      ② RectangleArea = 長 × 闊（兩個Decimal相乘）<br/>
      ③ 答案的Decimal位取決於Question要求（通常保留1-2位或寫精確值）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例7：一包米重 2.5 公斤，買 3 包共重多少公斤？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例8：一本書厚 0.8 厘米，0.5 本厚多少厘米？</div></div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic（Decimal點移位）：「乘十向右，乘零點一向左；位數等於零的個數」</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 5: TIERED PRACTICE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice（共 15 題）</div>
