<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>0.15 × 0.3 = ？（注意：位數加總 = 2+1 = 3，需要補零嗎？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
